      "contextBefore": "The tile overlay object substitutes actual index values for your template’s placeholders before requesting the tile.",
      "contextAfter": "`URLTemplate`: A string that you can use to build a URL to access your tile images. The string you specify can point to a local file or to an image on a remote server. To facilitate retrieving multiple tiles using the string, use the placeholder values `{x}`, `{y}`, `{z}`, and `{scale}` as stand-ins for the x and y tile indexes, the zoom level, and the resolution of the tile image. If this parameter is `nil`, you need to provide custom implementations for the tile-loading methods of this class.",
